# Strangers (non-regular guests) — design/v0.2.md §E, `src/sim/names.rs`.
# Until Karolina knows a stranger they are shown by a description: `stranger.<phrase>.<f|m>`
# (whole phrases — never glued — with the grammar of the presentation) and a 1–2 word
# `….short` for the ticket rail (the visual short form stands in when it doesn't fit).
# Descriptions are labels: capitalised, no article. No colour words (the look decides them).

